# Design Tokens

## Color Palette
Never hardcode hex values. Use Tailwind token classes or CSS variables:

| Token | Value | Tailwind Class |
|---|---|---|
| Primary (forest green) | `#1f5138` | `text-primary`, `bg-primary`, `border-primary` |
| Accent (sesame gold) | `#c9a246` | `bg-accent`, `border-accent` (use `text-accent-strong` `#8a6a1c` for gold text on light backgrounds) |
| Cream (soft sage tint) | `#eef4ef` | `text-cream`, `bg-cream` |
| Dark (deep green-ink) | `#10261b` | `text-dark`, `bg-dark` |
| Muted | `#56645c` | `text-muted`, `bg-muted` |
| Background (ivory) | `#fbfaf6` | `bg-background` |
| Border | `#dbe3dd` | `border-border` |
| Status | success `#177245`, warning `#a35a07`, destructive `#b42318`, info `#1d5f8a` | `text-success`, `bg-success-soft`, `text-warning`, `bg-warning-soft`, ... |

CSS variables available globally:
```css
var(--color-primary)  /* #1f5138 */
var(--color-accent)   /* #c9a246 */
var(--color-cream)    /* #eef4ef */
var(--color-dark)     /* #10261b */
var(--color-muted)    /* #56645c */
```

## Typography
Use Tailwind typography classes only — never hardcode `font-family`, `font-size`, or `font-weight`:

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<h1 style={{ fontSize: '48px', fontWeight: 700, fontFamily: 'Playfair Display' }}>

// ✅ GOOD
<h1 className="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-dark">
```

- `font-display` — Fraunces (headings / brand)
- `font-sans` — DM Sans (body / UI)

## Spacing & Shadows
Use the extended Tailwind / theme scale — never raw px/rem values in className strings for colors or fonts.

## Examples

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — hardcoded color
<button className="bg-[#1f5138] text-[#ffffff]">

// ✅ GOOD — design token
<button className="bg-primary text-primary-foreground">
```
